# Workflow: Add New Feature

## 1. Confirm requirements
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `.ai/project_profile.yaml`
- Capture acceptance criteria and edge cases
- Create a feature branch if on master

## 2. Plan the change
- Identify the files to modify
- Decide whether new files are required
- Outline test updates
- Define interfaces for new functions or classes

## 3. Implement
- Keep changes focused and minimal
- Follow existing naming and structure conventions
- Add docstrings or comments for public APIs

## 4. Test
- Add or update tests following existing patterns

## 5. Validate
- Confirm functionality in the target environment

## 6. Finalize
- Update documentation if behavior changed
- Commit with a descriptive message
- Consider running `/code-review` before pushing
